# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Internal working material and placeholder content.
#
# The primary control is physical: this repo's root is the app
# directory, and internal documents live above it, outside the
# git working tree, where they cannot be staged by accident.
# The patterns below are only a backstop for a stray copy.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/internal/
/docs/internal/
*.pdf
**/specimen/
*.specimen.*
*-specimen.*
